--
--   **Definitions.** The statement is written with `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.FordRenewalInput`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.FordUnitPrimeBoxInput`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.M`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.MertensProductInput`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.PrimeNumberTheoremInput`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.R`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.TotientTuple` and `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.candidateTuples` (definitions bundle `OAIQ233A000` of this split); `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.G`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.fk`, `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.m` and `OAI.TotientAsymptotic.tupleNormalization` (the published bundle `Def_TotientAsymptotic`).
